# Frontend implementation contract

Read `specs/frontend/PRD.md`, `DESIGN.md`, `TECH_STACK.md`, and `TESTING_PLAN.md` before changing matching files. Words for short code, TTL, and expiry come from `specs/domain/glossary.md`.

## API

The UI calls only `POST /api/v1/shorten` as written in `specs/contracts/openapi.yaml`. `urlshortener_web.shorten` builds that JSON. It does not add stats, auth, custom aliases, or a second error shape. A short link is opened with a normal browser navigation to the absolute `shortUrl`. Do not `fetch` or `httpx` that redirect.

Dev traffic goes through the port 5173 proxy in `TECH_STACK.md`. Do not add a CORS middleware to `backend/` from this rule.

## Stack

Python 3.13, Starlette, Jinja2, Uvicorn, httpx. Dependencies are the allow-list in `specs/frontend/TECH_STACK.md`. No UI kit, no chart library, no analytics SDK, no Node.js toolchain.

```python
# blank lifetime — key omitted
{"longUrl": "https://example.com/docs"}

# filled lifetime
{"longUrl": "https://example.com/docs", "ttlInDays": 365}
```

## UI

Follow `specs/frontend/DESIGN.md`: paper and ink palette, Fraunces and Source Sans 3, and the four local pictures (hero plus three steps). Every picture has alt text. Ship the images under `frontend/src/urlshortener_web/static/assets/` and the fonts under `static/fonts/`. Do not hotlink them.

Show `message` from a **400** or **503** body. Leave TTL blank to omit `ttlInDays`. The success line is “Short link ready” for every **201**, including an idempotent reuse.
